# Surge RULE-SET: AI Services (fixed egress)
# Updated: 2026-11-03
# Format: One match rule per line, NO policy appended.
# Usage: RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/krbedison-cloud/writing/main/surge/ai-services.list,AI-Fixed
# Configure AI-Fixed as a manual select policy group with a fixed proxy.
# Rules must precede broad rules and FINAL.
#
# OpenAI / ChatGPT / Codex
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openaimerge.com
#
# Gemini / AI Studio / NotebookLM (service-specific Google hosts only)
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
#
# Grok / xAI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
#
# Claude / Anthropic
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
#
# Perplexity
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai
#
# AI APIs and platforms
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openrouter.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepseek.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,character.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hf.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,replicate.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,together.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fireworks.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cerebras.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,groq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mistral.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cohere.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cohere.ai
#
# AI media
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,elevenlabs.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,runwayml.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,midjourney.com
#
# Notes:
# - Shared authentication/CDN domains are intentionally excluded to avoid
#   forcing unrelated services onto the AI proxy.
# - GitHub is intentionally excluded; Codex cloud GitHub operations execute
#   in OpenAI cloud and do not traverse a home Surge gateway.
# - Static policy selection reduces local proxy switching but does not
#   guarantee a static public IP or prevent cloud-side disconnections.
